[run]
# No omit list — deliberately. Every module under `applire` is measured by the
# >=75% gate that the `backend-unit-tests` job enforces (--cov-fail-under=75,
# .github/workflows/test.yml).
#
# History, so this is not "simplified" back in: until 2026-08-03 this file
# omitted routers/*, retention/*, ocr/*, services/thumbnails.py and
# services/session.py, justified by the comment "covered by integration tests
# (tests/test_iter*.py, tests/integration/) ... run in the
# backend-integration-tests CI job". BOTH halves of that were false, and the
# second is worse than "stale":
#   * There is no `backend-integration-tests` job. The real one is
#     `integration-and-e2e-tests`. Zero matches for the cited name in .github/.
#   * Nothing exists at `tests/test_iter*.py`. The test_iter* files that DO
#     exist are `backend/tests/unit/test_iter2*.py` -- i.e. already inside the
#     UNIT run this very config measures. They were never an integration tier,
#     so the exemption pointed at coverage the unit gate was already counting.
# Five modules -- including every router -- were exempt from the gate on a
# promise of coverage nobody was delivering in the form described.
#
# Removing the omit list costs nothing. Measured 2026-08-03 on exactly the trees
# CI runs (tests/unit/ backend/tests/unit/), TOTAL coverage with NO omit is 91%
# against a 75% gate. The exemption was not load-bearing, it was vestigial.
#
# What the gate now sees, and where it is genuinely thin (2026-08-03 baseline):
#   services/session.py 92% . retention/worker.py 83% . routers/settings.py 92%
#   routers/jobs.py 89% . routers/documents.py 85% . routers/cv_color.py 82%
#   routers/session.py 74% . routers/cover_letter.py 72% . routers/flow.py 72%
#   routers/profile_enrich.py 71% . routers/cv.py 61% . routers/job.py 52%
#   routers/profile.py 44% . routers/application.py 39%
#   ocr/mistral_vision.py 47% . ocr/tesseract.py 36%
# Those thin routers are the real remaining gap. They are now inside the gate
# instead of exempted from it, so the number can only move deliberately.
